"""One-time migration of the unaccepted M1.1 drafts into workbench records.

Input: litepaper snapshot SRC-LP20 and the M1.1 draft package SRC-M1-DRAFTS.
Output: importable tiddler JSON. After import the workbench is authoritative.
Usage: python3 m1_records.py [--pilot]   (--pilot emits only MFS, honesty
scoring and operator-entry records plus what they link to.)
"""

